                        <annot xml:id="o1qoz0fu" plist="#m1ea5yhq" startid="m1ea5yhq">Deviating from the original score, section descriptors ("Introduzione", "A Due", ff.) are encoded as mdiv labels instead of staff group brace labels (as apparent in Leipzig: Breitkopf and Härtel 1803 [first ed.], BGA [1862–1890], Forberg 1922, among others) in order to avoid semantical errors within MEI and MSM. However, as of Verovio v5.6, mdiv labels are not rendered graphically yet.</annot>
